sequenceDiagram
    participant MVC as ASP.NET Core MVC
    participant Bus as EventBridge Bus
    participant Spring as Spring LiveOps
    participant Warehouse as Analytics Warehouse
    participant Ops as Ops Dashboard

    MVC->>Bus: AuditEventRecorded
    MVC->>Bus: GlobalOpsExported
    Spring->>Bus: LiveOpsSnapshotRefreshed
    Bus->>Warehouse: Store operational facts
    Warehouse->>Ops: Publish dashboard metrics
    Ops->>MVC: Drill into source workflow
